			<div class="content" id="post-content-1905753">
									

<p>Done, thanks. There are a couple of other dodgy sentences, but I didn't want to change the wording too much, so I left them as-is for now.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Suggested&nbsp;changes.</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">I&nbsp;put&nbsp;maybe&nbsp;too&nbsp;much&nbsp;thought&nbsp;into&nbsp;this.</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>&quot;photographic and shootage records&quot;<br />
&quot;shootage&quot; apparently isn't a word, you could use &quot;photographic and video records&quot;</p>
<p>&quot;The actual texts of the songs&quot;<br />
This is just my opinion, but &quot;lyrics&quot; or &quot;vocals&quot; might work better than &quot;texts&quot;</p>
<p>&quot;before brutally abrupting&quot;<br />
&quot;Abrupting&quot; isn't a word. You could go with &quot;before abruptly terminating&quot;, which has the same meaning of a sudden unplanned end to the transmission.</p>
<p>&quot;abrupting, after said creatures proceeded to supposedly kill and devour &quot;Mr. Gobbles&quot;.&quot;<br />
The wording here makes it tricky to tell what order things happened in.</p>
<p>If the camera cut out <em>before</em> Mr Gobbles was attacked, it should be &quot;after which said creatures proceeded to supposedly kill and devour Mr Gobbles.&quot; But then, how did the Foundation know what was going on? (I'm guessing this is why the word &quot;supposedly&quot; is in there, but the uncertainty is still a little weird)</p>
<p>If the camera cut out <em>after</em> Mr Gobbles was attacked, it should be &quot;after said creatures had proceeded to kill and devour Mr Gobbles&quot;. But then, the camera cutting out wouldn't really be that abrupt.</p>
<p>My suggestion is to have the camera cut out <em>during</em> the attack. &quot;as the creatures proceeded to kill and devour Mr Gobbles&quot;. That way you get the abruptness <em>and</em> the certainty!</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>The Great Turkey's first note also has some strange wording, but, y'know, he's a turkey.</p>

