<p>Oh, right. In retrospect, the &quot;hindler is real&quot; bit should have given it away. Guess I'm super dumb!</p>
<p>Now I have a lot of questions. Was everything sent out in the 1827-1 instances fake, to simulate a turkey world and lure turkeys in? Was the Turkey-Heron War mentioned in the romance novel real? Why do the notes become less convincing each time?</p>
